          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Try and redraw each sequence in Table 3 in your notebook. Can you draw the next shape in each sequence? Why or why not? After each sequence, describe in your own words what is the rule or pattern for forming the shapes in the sequence."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
