          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.55,
            0.834,
            0.639
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The word ‘regular’ refers to the fact that these shapes have equal-length sides and also equal ‘angles’ (i.e., the sides look the same and the corners also look the same). We will discuss angles in more depth in the next chapter."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.64,
            0.833,
            0.685
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The other shape sequences in Table 3 also have beautiful relationships with number sequences."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
